# Who may publish (write) or subscribe (read) to which topics.
# Requests go to the shop and payment services; their replies go to the response
# topic the hotel management service names in each request (MQTT 5 request/response).

user hotel-management
topic write shop/quotes/request
topic write payment/charges/request
topic write payment/refunds/request
topic read hotel-management/replies/#
topic readwrite hotel/reservations/#

user shop
topic read shop/quotes/request
topic write hotel-management/replies/#

user payment
topic read payment/charges/request
topic read payment/refunds/request
topic write hotel-management/replies/#
